Compact list blocks

```
- item

  > note
- next
.
<ul>
  <li>item
    <blockquote><p>note</p></blockquote>
  </li>
  <li>next</li>
</ul>
```

```
- fruit

  - apples
- vegetables
.
<ul>
  <li>fruit
    <ul>
      <li>apples</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>vegetables</li>
</ul>
```

```
- item

  second para
- next
.
<ul>
  <li><p>item</p>
    <p>second para</p>
  </li>
  <li><p>next</p></li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  %% just a note
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  [r]: /u
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  %% just a note
- b
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p></li>
  <li><p>b</p></li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  first

  {.c}
  second
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <p>first</p>
    <p class="c">second</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
